DESCRIPTION:The Institute for South Asia Studies and the Subir & Malini Ch
 owdhury Center for Bangladesh Studies at UC Berkeley are proud to co-spons
 or 3rd i’s 24th Annual San Francisco International South Asian Film Fest
 ival . This year’s festival showcases groundbreaking cinema from India\,
  Pakistan\, France\, the UK\, Canada\, and the United States—ranging fro
 m witty comedies and nuanced dramas to science fiction and true-to-life st
 ories—celebrating the richness of South Asia and its diaspora on screen.
  Click HERE to view this year’s program and purchase tickets.\nCategory:
  Films\nOriginal listing: https://events.berkeley.edu/csas/event/327730-3r
 d-is-24th-annual-sf-intl-south-asian-film-festival
