DESCRIPTION:The Adult Choir and Schola of St. Luke’s Episcopal Church pr
 esent Maurice Duruflé’s masterpiece in a concert setting\, conducted by
  William Fred Scott. The concert will be preceded by a 6 p.m. lecture on t
 he work by Ned Tipton\, renowned student of the late Marie-Madeleine Duruf
 lé and noted authority on the music of Maurice Duruflé. The concert feat
 ures New York based mezzo-soprano Tami Petty and cellist Guang Wang\, acco
 mpanied in the solo organ version by organists Matthew Michael Brown and J
 onathan Easter.\nCategory: Music\nOriginal listing: https://www.artsatl.or
